cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this task in research, please cite it as below and name it in your Methods section."
type: software
title: "Room Recall Task: an object-location memory task for colored-noise research"
abstract: >-
  An object-location memory task for in-lab studies. Participants study a
  realistic rendered room, complete a short filled delay, then drag each object
  from a tray back to where it was in the now-empty room. Runs on PsychoPy or
  pygame, with counterbalanced conditions, manipulation checks and per-object
  error data.
